<title>CHINA: TRADING IN CHINA PHARMACEUTICAL SUSPENDED.</title>
<headline>TRADING IN CHINA PHARMACEUTICAL SUSPENDED.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of China Pharmaceutical Enterprise &amp; Investment Corp Ltd was suspended on Wednesday afternoon pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said.</p>
</text>
